<div class="globo-form-control layout-1-column "  data-type='paragraph' data-element-id='paragraph-2'>
    <div tabindex="0" class="globo-paragraph" id="paragraph-2" ><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Legal made us put this here:</span></p><p><br></p><p><em style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">By submitting a photo, story, or any related content for Gibson’s “50 Years in Music City” campaign, you confirm that the submission is your original work and that you have obtained all necessary rights and permissions from any identifiable individuals in the image. You further confirm that all individuals depicted are over the age of 18, unless you are the parent or legal guardian of any minors shown. You agree to fully indemnify and hold harmless Gibson, Inc., its affiliates, licensees, and assigns from any claims arising from your failure to obtain the necessary rights, permissions, or consents. You grant Gibson a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable right to use, reproduce, display, distribute, publish, modify, and create derivative works from your submission, in whole or in part, in any media now known or developed in the future, for promotional, marketing, social media platforms or other lawful purposes, without further notice or compensation. You acknowledge that submissions may be edited for clarity or formatting at Gibson’s discretion. You retain ownership of any copyright in your submission but waive any right to inspect or approve how it is used. Submissions must be appropriate for public display and free of offensive, unlawful, or inappropriate content. Gibson reserves the right to reject any submission for any reason. By participating, you agree to be bound by these terms.</em></p><p><br></p></div>
