    <h3 tabindex="0" class="heading-title globo-heading" id="heading-2" >Submit a Photo</h3>
    <p tabindex="0" class="heading-caption"><br>This year marks 50 years of Gibson in Nashville, and we’re starting the celebration by highlighting the people who make it all possible: you.
To help launch our new Gibson.com site, we’re creating a digital campaign called “50 Years in Music City”, and we’d love for Gibson employees to be the first to take part.
<br>
<br>
