      window.Globo.FormBuilder.forms[107737] = {"107737":{"elements":[{"id":"group-9","type":"group","label":"Page 1","description":"","elements":[{"id":"paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","text":{"en":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p>","de":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p>","es":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p>","fr":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p>","it":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p>","nl":"<p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking