    <div tabindex="0" class="globo-paragraph" id="paragraph-2" ><p>This year, Gibson proudly celebrates 50 years in Nashville, and we’re kicking off the celebration honoring the heart of our brand – the people behind the music.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In support of our new Gibson.com site, we’re launching “50 Years in Music City”, a digital campaign featuring our employees and Gibson guitars and gear in the iconic places and spaces across Nashville.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Selected submissions will be featured as part of an interactive experience on our new site – a tribute to the people, stories and sounds that define Gibson.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Deadline to submit: July 3, 2025.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Join us in celebrating five decades in Music City – and be part of the story.&nbsp;</p></div>
